<title>UK: HSBC Investment Bank appoints vice chair.</title>
<headline>HSBC Investment Bank appoints vice chair.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC Investment Bank, the investment banking arm of HSBC Holdings, said it has appointed Joan Beck as vice chairman of its investment banking division, reporting to chief executive Keith Harris.</p>
<p>He will be responsible for senior level marketing and has previously worked for MC Securities, CS First Boston, Merrill Lynch and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
